    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460), as amended by theLand Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, was givenby me that the Government intends to acquire the followingland for catchment of Hedeniya water supply system.",
